<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To reconcile my natural life</l><l>to God from self and flesh</l><l>Requires a further step be made</l><l>to keep me new and fresh;</l><l>Deny the soul and live to Him,</l><l>my natural life condemn,</l><l>With Christ I have been crucified,</l><l>identified with Him.</l><l>Be reconciled! Be reconciled!</l><l>Be reconciled in Christ!</l><l>For Christ my righteousness becomes</l><l>the Christ who is my life,</l><l>The Christ who is my life!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Be reconciled to enter in,</l><l>enjoy the holy place;</l><l>Press on to cross the riven veil,</l><l>enjoy Christ face to face;</l><l>Christ’s presence with His glory shines,</l><l>with Christ I am enthralled,</l><l>With inward peace I boast in God</l><l>in Christ, my all in all.</l><l>Be reconciled! Be reconciled!</l><l>Be reconciled to Him;</l><l>Incorporated, one with God,</l><l>the New Jerusalem,</l><l>The New Jerusalem!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
